# The examples' Dockerfiles (examples/*/Dockerfile) build from the repository
# root because each example module replaces the library with ../../. Keep the
# build context to what a Go build can use: docs/ alone carries a node_modules
# tree far larger than the rest of the repository.
.git/
.claude/
.github/
.vscode/
docs/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/bin/
coverage.txt
examples/*/results/
custom-gcl
*.test
*.out
